WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
So together, let us uphold our sacred duty to our people

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.600
and to our citizens.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.880
Let us protect their borders, ensure their safety,

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.040
preserve their cultures, treasure, and traditions,

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.520
and fight, fight, fight for their precious dreams

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.200
and their cherished freedoms.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.000
And in friendship —

